(
    title: "Crystal Castles",
    description: Some("Bentley Bear trots through isometric castle mazes hoovering up gems ahead of the witch Berthilda and her creatures, hunting the honey pots and secret warps that made the arcade a score-chaser\'s favourite. The port trades the arcade\'s trackball for the joystick — a change even the original\'s programmer lamented — but keeps the maze-clearing loop faithfully intact."),
